  "puzzle.c1_gexun.hints.1": "The first Chinese character of each line of “March” gives 梧桐树下 (Under the Wutong Tree). The radical card says to take the first Wubi key of each character for a four-character phrase: 梧 SGKG, 桐 SMGK, 树 SCFY, 下 GHI.",
  "puzzle.c1_gexun.hints.2": "Answer: sssg",
  "puzzle.c1_gexun.onSolve.toast": "PigeonChat login successful. Reading local chat history…",
  "puzzle.c1_gexun.solvedText": "SSSG. 梧桐树下 — Under the Wutong Tree.",
  "note.c1_n_gexun.text": "PigeonChat password SSSG: Lin Wan’s “March” is an acrostic. The first Chinese character of each line spells 梧桐树下 (Under the Wutong Tree). For a four-character phrase, use the first Wubi key of each character.",
  "file.c1_ticket.html": "<div class=\"scan\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 420\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<rect width=\"640\" height=\"420\" fill=\"#f3ead2\"/>\n<rect x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"600\" height=\"380\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7a6a4a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<text x=\"320\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"SimSun, 'Songti SC', serif\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#222\">1999 年全省青少年信息学竞赛（复赛）</text>\n<text x=\"320\" y=\"96\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"SimSun, 'Songti SC', serif\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#222\">准　考　证</text>\n<rect x=\"470\" y=\"120\" width=\"110\" height=\"140\" fill=\"#ddd\" stroke=\"#999\"/>\n<text x=\"525\" y=\"195\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"SimSun, serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#888\">（照片）</text>\n<g font-family=\"SimSun, 'Songti SC', serif\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#222\">\n<text x=\"50\" y=\"140\">姓　　名：许嘉</text>\n<text x=\"50\" y=\"170\">学　　校：梧城市第七中学</text>\n<text x=\"50\" y=\"200\">准考证号：99-0417</text>\n<text x=\"50\" y=\"230\">考　　点：省城 · 省师范大学计算机楼</text>\n<text x=\"50\" y=\"268\">5 月 16 日（日）　14:00 前报到，住省师大招待所</text>\n<text x=\"50\" y=\"296\">5 月 17 日（一）　笔　试　08:30—11:30</text>\n<text x=\"50\" y=\"324\">5 月 17 日（一）　上机（第三场）　19:00—22:00</text>\n<text x=\"50\" y=\"352\">5 月 18 日（二）　08:30 颁奖，统一返程</text>\n</g>\n<text x=\"50\" y=\"384\" font-family=\"SimSun, serif\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#555\">注：上机考试按准考证号分三场。考试期间不得离开考场，不得携带软盘。</text>\n<circle cx=\"540\" cy=\"330\" r=\"46\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c0392b\" stroke-width=\"4\" opacity=\"0.8\"/>\n<text x=\"540\" y=\"326\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"SimSun, serif\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#c0392b\" opacity=\"0.85\">竞赛委员会</text>\n<text x=\"540\" y=\"344\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"SimSun, serif\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#c0392b\" opacity=\"0.85\">专用章</text>\n</svg></div><details class=\"i18n-notes\"><summary>English transcript of the original admission card</summary><p>1999 Provincial Youth Informatics Competition — second round. Admission card.<br>Name: Xu Jia. School: Wucheng No. 7 High. Admission number: 99-0417.<br>Venue: Computer Building, Provincial Normal University, provincial capital.<br>May 16 (Sunday): check in before 14:00; stay at the university guesthouse.<br>May 17 (Monday): written exam 08:30—11:30.<br>May 17 (Monday): practical exam, third session, 19:00—22:00.<br>May 18 (Tuesday): awards at 08:30; return together.<br>Note: practical exams are divided into three sessions by admission number. Candidates must not leave the room during the exam or bring floppy disks.</p></details>",
  "file.c1_photo_open.html": "<div class=\"photo\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 420\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<rect width=\"640\" height=\"420\" fill=\"#4a5258\"/>\n<rect x=\"150\" y=\"60\" width=\"340\" height=\"260\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#d9d4c5\"/>\n<rect x=\"175\" y=\"82\" width=\"290\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/>\n<rect x=\"175\" y=\"82\" width=\"290\" height=\"22\" fill=\"#000080\"/>\n<text x=\"183\" y=\"98\" font-family=\"SimSun, serif\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#fff\">梧桐树下 - Microsoft Internet Explorer</text>\n<text x=\"320\" y=\"160\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"KaiTi, STKaiti, serif\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#2e6b2e\">梧桐树下</text>\n<text x=\"320\" y=\"192\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"SimSun, serif\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#333\">梧城七中学生自己的 BBS</text>\n<text x=\"320\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"SimSun, serif\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#666\">在线人数：3</text>\n<rect x=\"250\" y=\"320\" width=\"140\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#bdb7a6\"/>\n<rect x=\"120\" y=\"350\" width=\"400\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#cfc9b8\"/>\n<text x=\"600\" y=\"400\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"'Courier New', monospace\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ff8a1e\">'98 10 8</text>\n</svg></div><details class=\"i18n-notes\"><summary>Text visible in the original photo</summary><p>Under the Wutong Tree — a BBS for Wucheng No. 7 High students. Users online: 3. Camera date: October 8, 1998.</p></details>",
