  "file.c1_sysopini.text": "; WTBBS administration account configuration\n; DO NOT edit by hand! Damage this and the admin panel will not open.\n\n[sysop]\nuser=sysop\npwd=E3B9-01F7-7C2A-55D0      ; stored encrypted\npwd_changed=1999-05-19 07:55:02\npwd_hint=her first poem (Chinese pinyin title initials + month/day posted)\n\n[admin]\nco_admin=hanli\nrecycle=on                ; hidden in the admin recycle bin, not permanently deleted\nlog=on\n",
