  "file.c1_draft.text": "Handling the Recent Harmful Post (draft)\n\nAt 21:03 on May 17, someone posted on Chatterbox using the sysop account.\nI did not write that post.\nFrom the 16th to the 18th I was in the provincial capital for the informatics competition. On the 17th, from 19:00 to 22:00, I was in the examination room. Floppy disks were not allowed, and there was no network. The teacher accompanying us can confirm it.\n\nSomeone learned the password. I have already〔己经〕 changed it and hidden the post.\nTo Lin Wan—\n\n————\n\nI've written this part three times.\nThe first sounded like I was defending myself. The second sounded like a school notice.\nShe still has to come to class tomorrow. People will see her and bring up the post again.\nPut up the short announcement first. Say the rest in person.\n(Write it in To L.txt [给L.txt] and hide it for now.)",
  "note.c1_n_official.text": "Official account: at about 19:40 on 1999-06-21, Lin Wan fell from the platform at the top of the water tower after the outer railing broke from rust. Police ruled it an accident. At school, however, people said the post had driven her to suicide.",
  "dlg.c1_d_unsent.steps.7.npc": "They sat in the same computer lab, each keeping something they hadn't said.",
